---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About">
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-primary-900 mb-12">About The CI Team</h1>
        
        <div class="bg-white border border-primary-200 rounded-lg p-8 mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-6">Our Story</h2>
          <p class="text-primary-600 mb-6">
            The CI Team is a London-based consultancy founded by industry veterans with over 30 years of combined experience in banking and enterprise environments. We understand the unique challenges that large organizations face when implementing and maintaining CI/CD systems.
          </p>
          <p class="text-primary-600 mb-6">
            Our mission is to help teams release more often, reduce CI outages, and move faster with confidence. We achieve this through our deep expertise in CI/CD processes, infrastructure optimization, and automation.
          </p>
          <p class="text-primary-600">
            While we're based in London, we have extensive experience working with geo-distributed teams and are comfortable operating in fully remote environments. We're also happy to travel on-site when required by the team or project, ensuring we provide the most effective support regardless of location.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
          <div class="bg-white border border-primary-200 rounded-lg p-8">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-6">Our Expertise</h2>
            <ul class="space-y-4 text-primary-600">
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="text-accent mr-2">✓</span>
                <span>Extensive experience in financial services and enterprise environments</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="text-accent mr-2">✓</span>
                <span>Deep knowledge of CI/CD best practices and tools</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="text-accent mr-2">✓</span>
                <span>Expertise in Mac/iOS and Linux/Android CI infrastructure</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="text-accent mr-2">✓</span>
                <span>Proven track record in process optimization and automation</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          
          <div class="bg-white border border-primary-200 rounded-lg p-8">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-6">Our Approach</h2>
            <ul class="space-y-4 text-primary-600">
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="text-accent mr-2">✓</span>
                <span>Comprehensive analysis of existing CI/CD processes</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="text-accent mr-2">✓</span>
                <span>Customized solutions tailored to your specific needs</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="text-accent mr-2">✓</span>
                <span>Hands-on implementation and support</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="text-accent mr-2">✓</span>
                <span>Continuous improvement and optimization</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white border border-primary-200 rounded-lg p-8 mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-6">Team Culture</h2>
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-4">Our Values</h3>
              <ul class="space-y-4 text-primary-600">
                <li class="flex items-start">
                  <span class="text-accent mr-2">✓</span>
                  <span>Knowing when not to do something - we value thoughtful decision-making</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start">
                  <span class="text-accent mr-2">✓</span>
                  <span>Promoting a support culture - we believe in helping each other succeed</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start">
                  <span class="text-accent mr-2">✓</span>
                  <span>Balancing technical debt and requirements with pragmatism</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start">
                  <span class="text-accent mr-2">✓</span>
                  <span>Always asking "what's the right thing to do?"</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-4">Our Commitment</h3>
              <p class="text-primary-600 mb-4">
                We believe in building sustainable solutions that stand the test of time. Our team culture emphasizes:
              </p>
              <ul class="space-y-2 text-primary-600">
                <li>• Thoughtful decision-making</li>
                <li>• Collaborative problem-solving</li>
                <li>• Pragmatic approach to challenges</li>
                <li>• Continuous learning and improvement</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-white border border-primary-200 rounded-lg p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-6">Why Choose Us</h2>
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            <div class="text-center">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-2">Experience</h3>
              <p class="text-primary-600">30+ years combined experience in enterprise environments</p>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-2">Expertise</h3>
              <p class="text-primary-600">Deep knowledge across multiple platforms and technologies</p>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-2">Results</h3>
              <p class="text-primary-600">Proven track record of successful implementations</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout> 